      en: ["Located within the coastal wetlands and estuarine zones of the Volta Region.", "Characterized by dense mangrove forests, tidal mudflats, and the Lotor River.", "A critical resting and feeding habitat for numerous species of migratory waterbirds.", "Exploration is conducted primarily via silent, hand-paddled wooden canoes.", "Highly popular among specialized international ornithologists and bird-watchers.", "Protects a highly fragile ecosystem vulnerable to coastal development and pollution."]
